---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Prepare for Your Reading"
  ><PageHero
    eyebrow="Preparation"
    title="Bring your information—and your honest questions."
    lede="You do not need to study astrology before a reading. A little practical preparation helps you use the conversation well."
  /><section class="section">
    <div class="container reading-width prose">
      <h2>Confirm your birth information</h2><p>
        When possible, use a birth certificate or another reliable record for your date, exact time,
        city, and country of birth. Tell Mo how confident you are in the time.
      </p><h2>If your birth time is unknown</h2><p>
        Do not guess and present it as exact. Contact Mo before booking so she can explain which
        services or techniques remain appropriate.
      </p><h2>Choose a focus</h2><p>
        Write down one to three questions. Specific context is useful, but you do not need to
        disclose unnecessary sensitive details.
      </p><h2>Make space</h2><p>
        Choose a quiet, private place and allow a few minutes before and after the session. Bring
        something for notes if that helps you reflect.
      </p><div class="notice">
        <strong>Important:</strong> Astrology is not medical, psychological, legal, or financial care.
        Bring those questions to a qualified professional.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
